  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Skills Development &amp; Employment for Youth 2013-2017</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Yrkeskunskap och arbete f&#xf6;r ungdomar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet har som syfte att bidra till en v&#xe4;lfungerande arbetsmarknad och samtidigt st&#xf6;dja yrkesf&#xf6;rberedande utbildningar f&#xf6;r ungdomar och  unga m&#xe4;nniskor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to contribute to a            well-functioning labour market &amp; to support skills development &amp;      employment for youth in Cambidia. Specific objectives are (1)         Coordination &amp; support the implmentation of the National Youth        Strategy &amp; the program plan, (2) Strenthening &amp; further development   of NEA, (3)Actions to support skills development &amp; entrepreneurship.</narrative>
  </description>
